    "summary": "Battle Tactic, 1 CP, used as your Movement phase opens. Choose one of your TITANIC CHAOS KNIGHTS units, plus as many as three WAR DOG units of yours that are within 6\" of it. For the rest of the phase, whenever any of the chosen WAR DOG units performs a Normal move, an Advance move or a Fall Back move, the models in it may pass through other models and through terrain features. While doing so they may enter Engagement Range of the models they pass but must not finish the move inside it, and they pass any Desperate Escape test without rolling.",
